    "decision_dates": "Each game's own date. The fold's decision date is the end of the season (May 1), because forecasts are made throughout it; each forecast uses that season's games strictly before its date (the US game day). What is fit on other seasons (the margin's spread, the baselines' fits, the second stage's weights) is read as of October 31 before the season starts.",
