    "seasons": "2021 only seeds 2022's prior (a short season). 2022 and 2023 chose the settings and the feature groups. 2024 and 2025 are development seasons: scored here once, walk-forward, and scored before by an earlier prototype. 2026 is the test: no development run can load it (cbb/ratings/develop.py DevLoader; tests/test_cbb_model.py), and it was not read in any form before this block ran. 2027 is being played.",
